&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;YOUR ROLE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a key member of the UK Sales Team, you will be a key player in helping us scale our business and rolling out Shift Technology solutions to new clients in the United Kingdom.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your role will focus on establishing and expanding the company’s customer-based across the UK, thus managing C-level relationships within the region&#39;s P&amp;amp;C &amp;amp; Health insurance ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;YOUR RESPONSIBILITIES&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Representing Shift in the United Kingdom and Ireland;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Developing and implementing strategic territory plan to ensure Shift exceeds its revenue objectives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identifying and exploiting new opportunities and the right customer stakeholders;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Managing C-level relationships within the country&#39;s insurance ecosystem (federations, associations, clients, prospects, partners);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Independently and collaboratively strategize for solving deal-level challenges;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working on and submitting proposals and contracts to customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;YOU&#39;VE GOT WHAT IT TAKES IF YOU&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
