&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;2&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;5&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Architecture &amp;amp; Strategy: Resolve data architecture gaps. Align decisions across teams and drive platform coherence. Simplify, optimize, or extend solutions as needed.&lt;/span&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bring your enthusiasm and talents to Esri, creating&amp;nbsp;industry leading&amp;nbsp;ArcGIS products. The ArcGIS Maps SDKs allow developers to build modern mapping applications for mobile and desktop platforms, with 2D and 3D data&amp;nbsp;visualisation, and online or offline access. This is a fantastic opportunity to join the product development team and support the delivery of regular, high-quality releases in a collaborative and dynamic environment.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Help us improve our cross-platform GIS software libraries, built on the latest compilers and C++ standards, and create sample apps, developer documentation, and developer outreach.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Esri has a Relocation Assistance Program and can provide support with relocating to the Cardiff area for this position. Check out more details of the &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.esri.com/en-us/about/about-esri/cardiff-rd&quot;&gt;Esri R&amp;amp;D Center – Cardiff!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply curious, independent thought, and attention to detail to explore and understand the challenges that ArcGIS users face and provide usable, informative feedback on user experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand the customer, who are software developers, gathering requirements and use cases that translate into actionable code and doc improvements&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build rich and varied GIS datasets and maps, sample applications and articles that can be used to highlight product capabilities, explain&amp;nbsp;APIs&amp;nbsp;and guide user (developer) practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with your development team, and teams across Esri, to design, create, and&amp;nbsp;validate&amp;nbsp;the newest datasets and GIS workflows to support field mapping, data collection, spatial analysis and verify the functionality meets user workflows and is consistent with Esri ecosystem&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Describe GIS best practices and&amp;nbsp;demonstrate&amp;nbsp;how to apply these GIS workflows in internal team meetings, on product forums and websites, with customers, at Esri events, or in publications like the ArcGIS Blog&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Document technical topics and concepts, and produce developer-focused product documentation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learn about and collaborate in SDK environments (such as Kotlin, Qt, C#, Swift, Flutter, Python), to explore issues, investigate problems, and design and prototype enhancements&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build focused test code to&amp;nbsp;represent&amp;nbsp;complex situations for investigation and regression testing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Administer, automate, and manage online and database GIS systems and services to support the development of new product features and ongoing product releases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years of GIS experience (such as modeling, analyzing, or presenting geospatial data in a scientific, engineering, governmental, or post graduate academic environment)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with mapping, spatial data or GIS platforms such as ArcGIS or QGIS&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic programming in any modern language (e.g. Python, JavaScript, C#, Java), sufficient to understand variables, function calls, if-statements, loops and arrays&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong problem-solving and analytic skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven initiative and creativity to find ways to explore, investigate,&amp;nbsp;test&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;validate&amp;nbsp;software behavior&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and team collaboration skills&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience of, and interest in, scripting or coding to appreciate our developer users&#39; challenges and to communicate effectively with the development team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in GIS, geography, computer science, engineering, or related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Existing work authorisation for the United Kingdom&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recommended Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience and passion for working with cartography,&amp;nbsp;mapping&amp;nbsp;or geospatial data&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in or knowledge of layout, typography, and fonts for international text&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience of user communication and education such as having&amp;nbsp;been responsible for&amp;nbsp;product documentation, blogs, written or video tutorials, presentations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity using version control systems such as Git, for documentation and code&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with some of the scripting or coding languages which our SDKs target, and which we use for automation, such as using Kotlin, Qt, .Net, Swift, Flutter, Typescript or Python&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Master’s degree in GIS, computer science, engineering, or related field&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Base salary is one component of our total rewards strategy. Compensation decisions and the base range for this role take into account many factors including but not limited to skill sets; experience and training; licensure and certifications; and other business and organizational needs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A reasonable estimate of the base salary range is £37,080 - £58,092.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-EL1&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Onsite&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Company&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Esri, diversity is more than just a word on a map. When employees of different experiences, perspectives, backgrounds, and cultures come together, we are more innovative and ultimately a better place to work. We believe in having a diverse workforce that is unified under our mission of creating positive global change. We understand that diversity, equity, and inclusion is not a destination but an ongoing process. We are committed to the continuation of learning, growing, and changing our workplace so every employee can contribute to their life’s best work. Our commitment to these principles extends to the global communities we serve by creating positive change with GIS technology. For more information on Esri’s Racial Equity and Social Justice initiatives, please visit our website &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.esri.com/en-us/racial-equity/overview#engage-communities&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;If you don’t meet all of the preferred qualifications for this position, we encourage you to still apply!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Esri is an equal opportunity employer (EOE) and all qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, disability status, protected veteran status, or any other characteristic protected by law. If you need reasonable accommodation for any part of the employment process, please email &lt;a ---------- and let us know the nature of your request and your contact information. Please note that only those inquiries concerning a request for reasonable accommodation will be responded to from this e-mail address.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.esri.com/en-us/privacy/overview&quot;&gt;Esri Privacy&lt;/a&gt; Esri takes our responsibility to protect your privacy seriously. We are committed to respecting your privacy by providing transparency in how we acquire and use your information, giving you control of your information and preferences, and holding ourselves to the highest national and international standards, including CCPA and GDPR compliance.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;About StarRez&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;StarRez is the global leader in student housing software, providing innovative solutions for on and off-campus housing management, resident wellness and experience, and revenue generation. Trusted by 1,400+ clients across 25+ countries, StarRez supports more than 4 million beds annually with its user-friendly, all-in-one platform, delivering seamless experiences for students and administrators. With offices in the United States, Australia, the UK, and India, StarRez blends the robust capabilities of a global organization with the personalized care and service of a trusted partner.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 117, 219);&quot;&gt;The Role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;StarRez is seeking a talented, passionate, smart, resourceful, highly motivated sales professional to support our momentum and expansion in the EMEA student accommodation &amp;amp; PBSA market. If you love sales and have a passion for the student property management market, from new lead generation to closure, we want to connect with you! We are searching for talented, tech-loving team players who want to positively impact millions of residents&#39; lives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will be responsible for achieving new business revenue goals within assigned territory. From initial lead generation through product demonstration, relationship development, closure, and ongoing account management, you will have complete ownership of the planning and execution of new business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 117, 219);&quot;&gt;Role Specifics&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Location: &lt;/strong&gt;Remote (UK)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Travel:&lt;/strong&gt; 25% (The percentage of travel is an estimation and could vary based on business needs.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reporting Structure:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;This role reports to the Director of Sales, New Business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 117, 219);&quot;&gt;What You Will Own&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage assigned EMEA territory to achieve new customer acquisitions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Account management of new customer acquisitions until they’ve completed implementation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and manage tendering, RFP, and formal bid processes, including coordination with internal stakeholders to deliver competitive submissions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outbound prospecting and market coverage via email, phone, social, and other mediums as required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and develop prospect and existing account pipeline from initial lead to deal closure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide market insight and customer requirements to better position existing solutions both online and in person&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide feedback for new product development and future evolution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build long-term relationships with prospects, customers, and industry leaders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage infrastructure tools such as Salesforce, Gong, ChatGPT, &amp;amp; Zoom, as well as collaboration tools such as Slack &amp;amp; SharePoint, and social tools such as LinkedIn Sales Navigator, to build market/prospect data for effective data analytics and market insight&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist in creating and updating sales and marketing materials for web, print, and demonstration purposes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and develop effective partner relationships as needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Other duties as assigned&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 117, 219);&quot;&gt;Required Qualifications&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years in a B2B SaaS sales role OR 3+ years of experience in student accommodation, student property management, and/or multi-family property markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent verbal and written communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience in presenting and leading meetings with a range of stakeholders, including multiple levels of management and decision makers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive to create and execute on tactical and strategic initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong team orientation to help achieve individual as well as team goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven skills in developing new customer, prospect, and partner relationships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exercise professional judgment regarding issues management, and utilize effective problem analysis and resolution techniques&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to maintain a high level of productivity, manage multiple competing priorities, and work effectively under pressure and with time constraints in a fast-paced, complex, collaborative, and team-oriented environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to set, manage, and meet deadlines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-motivated, disciplined, and able to work independently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 117, 219);&quot;&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong outbound sales and existing account management skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling into Universities, PBSAs, or staff accommodation operations within the EMEA region&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of software licensing contracts, terms, conditions, pricing, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent attention to detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to successfully build rapport with stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to maintain a high level of productivity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to prioritize tasks and set, manage, and meet deadlines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 117, 219);&quot;&gt;Reasons to join our Team:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunity to be a part of a well-established, high-performance company that has been in business for over 30+ years&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A supportive team environment with emphasis on learning and development opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our Promise: You will learn, grow, and be appreciated for your impact and contributions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Z-Factor: Our most celebrated value, you will work with a team of caring, high-performing, and passionate people who have fun supporting our vision, innovation, and continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Even if you don&#39;t have all of the Preferred Qualifications listed above, but feel you have what it takes to succeed in the role, we would love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are proud of our diverse workforce and are dedicated to creating a safe and welcoming environment for all employees. People from various ethnicities, ages, genders, and abilities are encouraged to apply.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Notice to external Recruiters and Recruitment Agencies:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;StarRez will not accept unsolicited resumes from recruitment agencies, headhunters, or any other third parties for this role through this website or directly to any employee. StarRez and any of our subsidiaries will not pay fees to any third-party agency or company. In addition, we ask that you do not reach out to any employee with regards to this position, or any other positions, now, or in the future.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;StarRez is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3176 - VP, Data Strategy, UK - UK&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary and Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking an VP, Data Strategy to work on a client portfolio across Wavemaker &amp;amp; T&amp;amp;P UK. This individual will play a pivotal role in defining the role of data in our clients&#39; businesses and driving the adoption of Open Intelligence, InfoSum and the Open Media Studio (OMS) Platform across Wavemaker &amp;amp; T&amp;amp;P UK clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will accelerate the use of data to inform brilliant advertising strategies, managing client satisfaction, commercial health, and their understanding of our platform, solutions, and consulting services.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will support business growth through leading data strategy on key new business opportunities and driving organic growth from existing clients. This will be achieved by developing data strategies, evangelising our platform and capabilities, and providing thought leadership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This dynamic leader will shape our success by being accountable for achieving full penetration of the OMS Platform and Open Intelligence within all clients in their portfolio.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive Senior Client Partnership: act as the senior data strategy partner for your portfolio of clients, engaging with key leaders responsible for data and technology. You will translate their business needs &amp;amp; objectives into innovative data strategies and ensure our solutions deliver a measurable competitive advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Spearhead Platform Innovation: go beyond adoption to drive the evolution of our platforms including innovative new use cases. You will lead the charge on ensuring innovative application of platforms like Open Intelligence and InfoSum, shaping the use of Agentic AI, and ensuring the highest standards of data governance and ethics are upheld.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead Data Strategy Capability: You will set the foundations for smart, audience-led, and analytically driven media plans that deliver client outcomes. You will be responsible for overseeing and developing the Data Strategy talent across your portfolio of clients and assembling the right teams and capabilities to help our clients succeed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commercial and Revenue Management: You will partner with the UK Commercial teams to design proposals that deliver value and are competitive. The profitability of work delivered by the data strategy team within your client portfolio across Wavemaker &amp;amp; T&amp;amp;P will be your responsibility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thought Leadership: You will stay at the forefront of industry trends and technologies, providing thought leadership that sets WPP Media apart.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills and Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At WPP Media, we believe in the power of our culture and our people. It’s what elevates us to deliver exceptional experiences for both our clients and each other. In this role it will be critical to embrace WPP &amp;amp; WPP Media’s shared core values:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be Extraordinary by Leading Collectively to Inspire transformational Creativity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create an Open environment by Balancing People and Client Experiences by Cultivating Trust.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead Optimistically by Championing Growth and Development to Mobilize the Enterprise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What you’ll need&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven Leadership: Demonstrated experience in a leadership role within agency, Adtech, Advertising, or a closely related field, with a track record of successful outcomes in a matrixed organisational structure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical Expertise: A deep understanding of data products, technology, and trends within the advertising and marketing industry, with the ability to articulate complex technical concepts to both technical and non-technical stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consultative Selling: Proficiency in consultative selling, with the ability to understand client needs, articulate the value proposition of our platform, and tailor solutions to meet those needs effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer Focus: A relentless focus on customer success, with a passion for delivering exceptional client experiences and driving long-term relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Business Acumen: A history of driving revenue and achieving high levels of client satisfaction through strategic decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Change Management: The ability to navigate and drive organisational change, guiding stakeholders through the adoption process and overcoming resistance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communication Skills: Exceptional communication and relationship-building skills, as this role hinges on effective interaction with clients and agency stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic Vision: A strategic mindset that enables you to create a data strategy and vision that delivers growth for our clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bonus points&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in or with clients in the automotive, FMCG or government sectors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working within large marketing agencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with the WPP Media or WPP ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Who you are&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic Thinker: You have a strategic mindset and the capability to drive revenue growth and client satisfaction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Visionary Leader: You are a visionary leader with a deep understanding of data products and technology, able to guide your team and clients into the future.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relationship Builder: You possess the ability to effectively engage with clients and key agency stakeholders, nurturing relationships that drive success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thought Leader: You are an industry thought leader, actively contributing to the advancement of data-driven marketing and advertising technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passionate Advocate: You are passionate about leveraging data to create unbeatable advantages for our clients while building trust and understanding with their customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at WPP Media &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our passion for shaping the next era of media is powered by our commitment to&amp;nbsp;Be Extraordinary, investing in our employees to inspire transformational creativity. We also&amp;nbsp;Lead Optimistically,&amp;nbsp;firmly believing&amp;nbsp;in and&amp;nbsp;Championing Growth and Development&amp;nbsp;for every individual. This commitment allows WPP Media employees to&amp;nbsp;leverage&amp;nbsp;the extensive global WPP Media &amp;amp; WPP networks to pursue their passions, build vital professional connections, and learn at the&amp;nbsp;cutting edge&amp;nbsp;of marketing and advertising.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&amp;nbsp;Create an Open environment&amp;nbsp;built on trust and respect, where everyone feels they belong and has opportunities to progress. This inclusive culture is fostered through a variety of employee resource groups and frequent in-office events&amp;nbsp;showcasing&amp;nbsp;team wins, sharing thought leadership, and celebrating holidays and milestone events. Our comprehensive benefits package reflects this commitment, including competitive medical, group retirement plans, vision, and dental insurance, significant paid time off, preferential partner discounts, and employee mental health awareness days.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We believe the best work happens when&amp;nbsp;we&#39;re&amp;nbsp;together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection in this open and supportive environment.&amp;nbsp;That&#39;s&amp;nbsp;why&amp;nbsp;we’ve&amp;nbsp;adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you&amp;nbsp;require&amp;nbsp;accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&amp;nbsp; Please note that while our philosophy is the same across WPP, benefits may vary by office/country.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please note this is a UK based role and requires individuals to have the right to work in this location&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please read our Privacy Notice (&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy)&lt;/a&gt; for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While we appreciate all applications received, only those candidates selected for an interview will be contacted.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
